<head>
<no>1</no><heading guid="_86b2776d-3483-4209-8bd8-358fb284a8c3"
id="sec.1-he"><b>Name of Act</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act is the <legref refid="act-2022-071"
jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Port of
Newcastle (Extinguishment of Liability) Act
2022</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_54e0f28c-1021-4338-8d5e-abe728d72fd9"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>2</no><heading guid="_ab072d1e-826c-4431-b49e-c327280cc4f7"
id="sec.2-he"><b>Commencement</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act commences on the date of assent to this
Act.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_67d15c27-5bcb-4b35-965f-1937278eecd7"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>3</no><heading guid="_e4dde628-3cc3-4476-87a6-98ffc01591c5"
id="sec.3-he"><b>Act binds Crown</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act binds the Crown.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_5377ed98-cc30-49b8-903c-35e12f297111"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>4</no><heading guid="_56a3ac95-974e-40be-b400-5d2cdd65163b"
id="sec.4-he"><b>Definitions</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this Act&#8212;</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_d3097e13-e53d-4ac7-b936-71235133a5d3"
id="def.appointedperson"><b><i>appointed person</i></b></defterm> means the
person appointed by the Treasurer under section 6 to determine the relevant
compensation under section 7.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_ee736df3-b566-4e09-b4f6-e26159d00224"
id="def.Deed"><b><i>Deed</i></b></defterm> means the &#8220;Port Commitment
Deed&#8221; entered into by the State on or about 30 May 2014 relating to the
leasing of the Port of Newcastle, as in force from time to
time.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_8539fb77-60c8-46e5-ab62-759e2c1a7d9e" id="def.Portoperator"><b><i>Port
operator</i></b></defterm> means the operator of the Port of Newcastle who is
required to pay an amount to the State under the reimbursement provision of
the Deed.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_a849e987-ec0a-4201-8b0e-db4f2fefa491"
id="def.reimbursementprovision"><b><i>reimbursement
provision</i></b></defterm>, of the Deed, means a provision of the Deed
relating to the requirement for the operator of the Port of Newcastle, however
described in the Deed, to pay an amount to the State following receipt of a
notice that the State is required to pay an amount to an operating entity
associated with another port.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_bf93956a-1e64-4423-87da-e824611fab73"
id="def.relevantcompensation"><b><i>relevant
compensation</i></b></defterm>&#8212;see section
7(1).</txt></block></deflist>
</block>
<note type="legtext" guid="_ed2dfc45-db32-49f3-8cce-74647e3e58c2"
id="sec.4-note"><heading guid="_9331a87b-8cdd-4ce2-b4d2-58e1cc3aacaf"
id="sec.4-note-he"><b>Note&#8212;</b></heading>
<block><txt break.before="1">The <legref refid="act-1987-015" jurisd="NSW"
type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Interpretation Act
1987</i></name></legref> contains definitions and other provisions that affect
the interpretation and application of this Act.</txt></block></note>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_b612618b-ee62-4b4b-a3b2-1a5a096647b3"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>5</no><heading guid="_533f7594-00bd-4087-8d2f-3038a90ea9c3"
id="sec.5-he"><b>Port operator may request determination of
compensation</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_899aaa9a-8355-470e-b513-28fa6cf062a8"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Port operator may, by written notice to the
Treasurer and in accordance with the regulations, request a determination of
the relevant compensation under section 7.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_82ce9695-9617-484f-be38-1963ff1bad6e"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Port operator may make a single request under
subsection (1) only.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_a6e4345c-ce02-4250-a088-dbd50c3c217e"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>6</no><heading guid="_de040b2a-f7a4-4be0-b671-eb758ce9c1aa"
id="sec.6-he"><b>Appointment of person to determine
compensation</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_a13f16e6-de77-4aec-b2ca-655d291cf438"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">As soon as practicable after receiving a request
under section 5(1), the Treasurer must appoint a person to determine the
relevant compensation under section 7.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_b1b22a86-8f34-490c-8708-823615edc095"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Treasurer must appoint a person who
has&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_23e92c34-c7b2-4bfc-ae1e-b245976bdd2a" id="sec.6-ssec.2-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">appropriate qualifications or experience to
determine the relevant compensation, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_df5b25a3-32bc-4f09-a933-4cbe6796c478" id="sec.6-ssec.2-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">no pecuniary or other interest that appears to
raise a conflict with the proper exercise of the appointed person&#8217;s
functions under this Act.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.7">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_1145143d-ff28-47ce-9960-594fdd4d9717"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>7</no><heading guid="_6851ad4e-e60d-43e6-856d-57e53b527dba"
id="sec.7-he"><b>Determination of compensation</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.7-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_cc00c8ba-b828-4c37-92fb-b035ecaf62e0"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The appointed person must determine the amount by
which the financial value of the right to operate and lease the assets of the
Port of Newcastle for 98 years would have been reduced, in the opinion of a
reasonable person at the time the Deed was entered into, because of the
inclusion of the reimbursement provision in the Deed (the <defterm
type="definition" guid="_c1828c15-095b-4094-9350-12d73e118f18"
id="sec.7-def.relevantcompensation"><b><i>relevant
compensation</i></b></defterm>).</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.7-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_bc0b52ef-e93a-4ade-9e1d-bf6710030945"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The appointed person must determine the relevant
compensation under subsection (1) within&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_96452fc8-f4eb-4dd2-a329-965c4d729a09" id="sec.7-ssec.2-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">6 months of being appointed,
or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_e603f497-20d0-4a0d-a426-fb0ade7996b7" id="sec.7-ssec.2-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">another period prescribed by the
regulations.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.7-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_202911c9-4c72-40b3-9cb5-7c0b19832255"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In determining the relevant compensation, the
appointed person may&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_6595ee5d-3aff-4333-8ea0-d9eca97a7185" id="sec.7-ssec.3-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">obtain and consider information from the Port
operator and the State, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_6276f2ba-55cd-4fbd-8c09-fe923b01e7b0" id="sec.7-ssec.3-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">obtain and consider information from other
persons, including legal or financial advice, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_bf0513f6-4f5e-4406-b1d9-aa48e0197ba8" id="sec.7-ssec.3-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">consider any other matters the appointed person
considers relevant.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.8">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_7fd3fe1b-ab0f-41c0-8464-aaadab4ac86b"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>8</no><heading guid="_8ab8da54-ea79-4c48-ba5e-8cd1d0eb9c25"
id="sec.8-he"><b>Extinguishment of liability by payment of compensation to
State</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.8-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_e7d381e9-b5e2-452e-b69a-4c3f591b9f84"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">From the date on which the Port operator pays the
relevant compensation, adjusted for inflation under subsection (2), to the
State, the reimbursement provision of the Deed has no legal
effect.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.8-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_020813bb-0241-44bd-9cc0-2c7a9907084f"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The amount of relevant compensation must be
adjusted for changes in the Consumer Price Index for the period between the
date on which the Deed was entered into and the date on which the Port
operator pays the amount.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.8-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_57442032-4ff8-41b6-9f8d-cf8325aca643"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The regulations may provide for the calculation
of the amount payable by the Port operator to the State under this
section.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.8-ssec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_3ae4e9fa-553c-4df9-8a13-52b50800d097"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8-ssec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(4)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Subsection (1) prevails to the extent of an
inconsistency with another Act or law.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.9">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_ee7e0a88-a4bf-4c35-bfbd-15a0d4b04a21"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>9</no><heading guid="_dc4df023-b9b9-4302-9d8d-a030aabdad5a"
id="sec.9-he"><b>Regulations</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.9-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_f770f39b-279e-48da-9d01-cbfae04d0824"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Governor may make regulations about the
following&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_684664cf-6e40-4270-b758-b7a8080c23cb" id="sec.9-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">matters this Act expressly requires to be
prescribed by regulations,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_f24253cd-3590-47a9-b999-63821034c90d" id="sec.9-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">matters this Act expressly permits to be
prescribed by regulations,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_1006b88e-84be-44eb-a90f-14d61717c636" id="sec.9-ssec.1-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">other matters, but only to the extent that making
regulations about the matters is necessary or convenient to give effect to
this Act.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.9-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_0695caca-154f-49a8-9220-667f8f038fda"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The regulations must not be inconsistent with
this Act.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.9-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_db77d9db-806e-4e71-a02a-3e4ec647a1b0"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Regulations may be made about the following
matters&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
